# The build context is the repo root, which holds ~35 GB of clips in data/ and
# ~1 GB of build output in out/. Deny everything, then re-admit exactly what the
# Processing-job image copies. Docker cannot re-include a path whose parent is
# still excluded, hence the explicit models/ dance.
*

!src
!scripts
!deploy
!yolo11l.pt

!models
models/*
!models/phase2

# Never ship caches, secrets, or credentials into an image layer.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/*.egg-info
.git
